    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφημιόλιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, of
		a number, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>standing to another
				number in the ratio of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> to <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, i. e. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, the reciprocal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιόλιος</span> (<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1021a1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>.</div>
